      "APRA's Financial Claims Scheme trading-name page does not state a total entry count, and AFCA's search service expressly states that it is not AFCA's membership register.",
      "Some provider pages rendered product-rate fields dynamically without numeric values. Those rates remain gaps rather than being filled from comparison sites or memory.",
      "Products are normalised at the provider-marketed product-family level. LVR, repayment-type and fixed-term rate variants are nested in each product's pricing array rather than counted as separate products.",
      "Where one marketed family combines fixed and variable structures and the fixed taxonomy has no mixed class, taxonomy_class is unclassified and the reason is stated in gaps.",
      "Rates and fees are point-in-time data and may change after the stated effective date.",
      "A brief source quote is supplied for each source under copyright quotation limits; the cited first-party page is the evidence location for the complete extracted table or terms."
